  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "策略理論與企業經營",
    "sub_ename": "THEORIES AND ISSUES IN STRATEGIC MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "藉由企業經營管理議題（例如垂直整合、多角化、組織間網絡、海外直接投資和國家文化，組織學習等），帶領學生了解基本策略管理理論，並奠定基礎，使其能夠瞭解公司本質，養成策略知識概要，像是競爭策略和核心競爭力、動態能力、資源基礎理論、交易成本理論、制度理論全球化策略、多角化策略、範疇經濟、社會網絡等。主要以講授及討論等互動的方式進行。這些基礎知識可以幫助學生應用到不同企業經營層面的策略發展，例如財務，IT，行銷， 組織經濟，整合和多角化等。",
    "describe_eh": "The course draws upon theoretical perspectives from Knowledge-based and Dynamic Capabilities, Resource-Based View, Transaction Cost Economics, Institutional Theory, and Social Network Theory to supplement more traditional strategy approaches towards understanding firm performance and related issues. Many of the issues examined, for instance vertical integration, diversification, M & A, industry structure, organizational and inter-organizational networks, FDI and national culture, organizational learning, innovation management, are also common themes in other disciplines including different level strategy development such as finance, IT, marketing, organizational and economic sociology, and organizational integration.",
    "pre_subname": "MGT6010組織理論與管理",
    "pre_sub_id3": "MGT6010",
    "pre_sub_ename": "MGT6010 ORGANIZATION THEORY AND MANAGEMENT",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "分析相關經營管理議題文獻與理論發展",
      "describe_en": "Be able to analysis research data and literature relevant to current business management issues in relation to theoretical development"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "應用策略理論於企業經營議題",
      "describe_en": "Be able to outline a theory in a business management issue intradependence techniques"
    }
  ],
